			<div class="content" id="post-content-4844880">
									

<p>Hello Grigori!</p>
<p>There was a lot of deaths in the dictatorship, but one of the biggest problems Brazil has today is the dissapearence of the victims. So I figure out that the entity was an easy way to hide the bodies for the military and tied that with the historical context without taking the responsibility away from those who commited such atrocities.</p>
<p>JamaisJ said that too! I already changed that part in the sandbox, saying that the tests were done with cattle and not with D-Class! But since the Foundation don't have enought information about the creature because the military regime destroyed everything, I think they would try to conduct some experiments and use Class-D subjects for more risk tasks, not exactly sending them to death. But I will change that part entirely, since many people are criticing it negatively.</p>
<p>I understand that the subterranean SCP may be a bit overdone. But in the dictatorship people were tortuted in those isolated basements. I would like to trace a parallel with The Stomach, this SCP, meaning that horror is still feeding those victims.</p>
<p>Thanks for your feedback! Have a great day! :D</p>

