<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Genre (Optional):</strong> Horror</p>
<p><strong>Page Layout (Optional):</strong> The standard SCP article format.</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> The basic idea is a jointed 2 metre tall dummy made of hardwood. When someone views it, the person will begin to have visual hallucinations centered around the dummy, This usually drives the viewer to the point of insanity which almost always results in suicide. This is one of 2 methods of killing its victim. The alternative and less likely way of killing is directly attacking its victim, only moving when they are not looking.</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> The entity was found inside of an abandoned factory with unknown origins, after many people complaining about seeing a &quot;wooden thing&quot; watching them from inside the factory. Paranormal investigators found this interesting and went inside, more than half of them were found dead in their own homes. Foundation researchers went on the case and successfully captures it, with the cost of more than half of the researchers found dead in their offices.</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> The article will be short and simple, it won't have too much information about the entity leaving a mystery, I am also hoping to add a feeling of dread.</p>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> None.</p>

